{"suttaId":"tha-ap189","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[7122,7158],"vripara":"34"},"segments":{"tha-ap189:0.3":"Ekacintikattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap189:1.1":"“Yadā devo [devā (ka.)] devakāyā, cavate [cavanti (ka.)] āyusaṅkhayā;","tha-ap189:1.3":"Tayo saddā niccharanti, devānaṃ anumodataṃ.","tha-ap189:2.1":"‘Ito bho sugatiṃ gaccha, manussānaṃ sahabyataṃ;","tha-ap189:2.3":"Manussabhūto saddhamme, labha saddhaṃ anuttaraṃ.","tha-ap189:3.1":"“‘Sā te saddhā niviṭṭhāssa, mūlajātā patiṭṭhitā;","tha-ap189:3.3":"Yāvajīvaṃ asaṃhīrā, saddhamme suppavedite.","tha-ap189:4.1":"“‘Kāyena kusalaṃ katvā, vācāya kusalaṃ bahuṃ;","tha-ap189:4.3":"Manasā kusalaṃ katvā, abyāpajjaṃ [abyāpajjhaṃ (syā.), appamāṇaṃ (itivuttake 83)] nirūpadhiṃ.","tha-ap189:5.1":"“‘Tato opadhikaṃ puññaṃ, katvā dānena taṃ bahuṃ;","tha-ap189:5.3":"Aññepi macce saddhamme, brahmacariye nivesaya’.","tha-ap189:6.1":"“Imāya anukampāya, devā devaṃ yadā vidū;","tha-ap189:6.3":"Cavantaṃ anumodanti, ehi deva punappunaṃ [devapuraṃ puna (syā.)].","tha-ap189:7.1":"“Saṃvego me [saṃviggohaṃ (syā.)] tadā āsi, devasaṅghe samāgate;","tha-ap189:7.3":"Kaṃsu nāma ahaṃ yoniṃ, gamissāmi ito cuto.","tha-ap189:8.1":"“Mama saṃvegamaññāya, samaṇo bhāvitindriyo;","tha-ap189:8.3":"Mamuddharitukāmo so, āgacchi mama santikaṃ.","tha-ap189:9.1":"“Sumano nāma nāmena, padumuttarasāvako;","tha-ap189:9.3":"Atthadhammānusāsitvā, saṃvejesi mamaṃ tadā.","tha-ap189:10.1":"“Tassāhaṃ vacanaṃ sutvā, buddhe cittaṃ pasādayiṃ;","tha-ap189:10.3":"Taṃ dhīraṃ abhivādetvā, tattha kālaṃkato ahaṃ.","tha-ap189:11.1":"“Upapajjiṃ sa [upapajjissaṃ (sī.)] tattheva, sukkamūlena codito;","tha-ap189:11.3":"Kappānaṃ satasahassaṃ, duggatiṃ nupapajjahaṃ.","tha-ap189:12.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap189:13.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā ekacintiko thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap189:14.1":"Ekacintikattherassāpadānaṃ sattamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
